# Copy to .env.local. Values are inlined into the browser bundle at build time: no private secrets here.
# Runtime selectors have no defaults. Demo credentials are intentionally public and belong only
# to isolated demo accounts. `next dev` / `next build` stop on an incomplete demo configuration.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOALPULSE_PROFILE: test | dev | demo   (demo only runs against the real gateway)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_MODE:          mock    = recorded Goal Intelligence conversations, no backend, labelled "Mock mode"
#                                gateway = real public gateway, demo sign-in with an HttpOnly cookie
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GATEWAY_URL:       http(s) origin of the public gateway (gateway mode only);
#                                no credentials, path, query or fragment

# Local UI work without a backend:
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOALPULSE_PROFILE=dev
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_MODE=mock

# Demo against the real stack (comment the two lines above, uncomment these):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOALPULSE_PROFILE=demo
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_MODE=gateway
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GATEWAY_URL=http://localhost:8000
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_USER_A_USERNAME=demo-a
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_USER_A_PASSWORD=demo-a-pass
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_USER_B_USERNAME=demo-b
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_USER_B_PASSWORD=demo-b-pass
